# 🟢 4️⃣ Nested Document Queries

Example transaction:

```json
{
  "txnId": "T2001",
  "metadata": {
    "merchant": "Amazon",
    "category": "Shopping"
  }
}
```

---

## 🎯 Find all Amazon transactions

```js
db.transactions.find({
  "metadata.merchant": "Amazon"
})
```

Used in:

* Merchant analytics
* Spend analysis
* Business dashboards

